    "summary": "Replace WebSocket integration test with process-bound verification to avoid infinite server hang",
    "rationale_summary": "The current test runs 'python backend/app.py' which starts a persistent Uvicorn server that never exits, causing timeout failures. We need to verify server startup without waiting for an impossible shutdown. The solution is to use a subprocess check that confirms the server is listening on port 8000 within 30 seconds, then exits.",
